# API

## Single-file components
{: .col-2}

### Parse

```elixir
Vize.parse_sfc(source)
```

Template, scripts, styles, and custom blocks, with locations.

### Compile

```elixir
Vize.compile_sfc(source,
  filename: "App.vue",
  scope_id: "7a7a37b1",
  vapor: false,
  ssr: false,
  strip_types: false,
  source_map: false,
  custom_renderer: false
)
```

### Analyze

```elixir
Vize.analyze_sfc(source, mode: :full)
```

`%Vize.Croquis{}` with props, bindings, and template expressions.

### Lint

```elixir
Vize.lint(source, "App.vue")
```

### Declarations

```elixir
Vize.generate_dts(source, filename: "App.vue")
```

### Bundler helpers

```elixir
Vize.SFC.scope_id("src/App.vue", root: root)
Vize.SFC.collect_template_assets(source)
Vize.SFC.rewrite_asset_references(code, assets)
Vize.SFC.external_sources(source)
```

## Templates
{: .col-2}

### Render function

```elixir
Vize.compile_template(source,
  mode: "function",
  ssr: false
)
```

### SSR

```elixir
Vize.compile_ssr(source)
```

### Vapor

```elixir
Vize.compile_vapor(source,
  ssr: false,
  diagnostics: false,
  template_syntax: :standard
)
```

### Vapor IR

```elixir
Vize.vapor_ir(source)
Vize.vapor_split(source)
```

## CSS
{: .col-2}

### Compile

```elixir
Vize.CSS.compile(css,
  minify: true,
  targets: %{chrome: 80, safari: 14},
  scoped: false,
  scope_id: "data-v-7a7a37b1",
  css_modules: false,
  filename: "app.css"
)
```

Targets apply only with `minify: true`.

### Bundle

```elixir
Vize.CSS.bundle(path,
  minify: true,
  targets: %{safari: 14},
  css_modules: false
)
```

### Sass

```elixir
Vize.CSS.compile_sass(scss,
  syntax: :scss,
  filename: path,
  load_paths: ["assets/css"],
  compressed: false
)
```

### URLs

```elixir
Vize.CSS.collect_urls(css)
Vize.CSS.rewrite_urls(css, fn url -> :keep end)
Vize.CSS.select(css, :dependencies)
```

### AST

```elixir
{:ok, %{ast: ast}} = Vize.CSS.parse_ast(css)
ast = Vize.CSS.postwalk(ast, & &1)
Vize.CSS.print_ast(ast, minify: true)
```
